<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n53522" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κᾰρύ̆-ϊνος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of nuts</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔλαιον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					11.871
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. Χρῶμα</span>
			<i>nutbrown</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Sens.</u>
				78
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καρόϊνος</span>.
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>made of walnut-wood</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σανίδες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					11(2).203
				</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>B</u>
				100
			</span></i> (Delos, <span class="entity">iii B. C.</span>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥάβδος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Ge.</u>
					30.37
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Je.</u>
				1.11
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καρυΐνη, ἡ</span>, <i>narrow jar,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gp.
				13.7.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Καρύϊνος οἶνος</span>, 
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάροινον</span>
			.</div>
